[claude:event result] {"duration_api_ms":9995,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3010467b-f1b8-456d-b08a-c163ad25fcb2","total_cost_usd":0.007560600000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":802,"cache_read_input_tokens":12921,"output_tokens":834,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":223},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":802},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":9,"output_tokens":834,"cache_read_input_tokens":12921,"cache_creation_input_tokens":802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":802,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1017,"outputTokens":14,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0010869999999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5":{"inputTokens":9,"outputTokens":834,"cacheReadInputTokens":12921,"cacheCreationInputTokens":802,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0064736,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":223,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I'll help you set up a git server with automatic deployment to a web server. Here's a comprehensive setup guide:\n\n## Server Setup\n\nRun these commands on your server:\n\n```bash\n# Create directories\nsudo mkdir -p /git/server\nsudo mkdir -p /var/www/html\nsudo chown $(whoami):$(whoami) /git/server /var/www/html\n\n# Initialize bare git repository\ncd /git/server\ngit init --bare\n\n# Create the post-receive hook for automatic deployment\ncat > /git/server/hooks/post-receive << 'EOF'\n#!/bin/bash\nDEPLOY_DIR=\"/var/www/html\"\ncd $DEPLOY_DIR\ngit --git-dir=/git/server --work-tree=$DEPLOY_DIR checkout -f\nEOF\n\nchmod +x /git/server/hooks/post-receive\n\n# Initialize the deployed directory with the repo\ngit clone --bare /git/server /tmp/init_repo\ncd /var/www/html\ngit init\ngit remote add origin /git/server\n```\n\n## Web Server Setup\n\nChoose one of these options:\n\n### Option 1: Python (simplest)\n```bash\ncd /var/www/html\npython3 -m http.server 8080\n```\n\n### Option 2: Nginx (production-ready)\n```bash\nsudo apt-get install nginx\nsudo tee /etc/nginx/sites-available/default > /dev/null << 'EOF'\nserver {\n    listen 8080 default_server;\n    server_name _;\n    root /var/www/html;\n    index index.html;\n    location / {\n        try_files $uri $uri/ =404;\n    }\n}\nEOF\n\nsudo systemctl restart nginx\n```\n\n## How it works\n\n1. When you push to `origin master`, the post-receive hook runs automatically\n2. It checks out the latest code into `/var/www/html`\n3. The web server on port 8080 serves those files\n4. `curl http://server:8080/hello.html` retrieves the file\n\n## Client Side (your computer)\n\n```bash\ngit clone user@server:/git/server\ncd server\necho \"hello world\" > hello.html\ngit add hello.html\ngit commit -m \"add hello.html\"\ngit push origin master\n```\n\nThen verify from anywhere:\n```bash\ncurl http://server:8080/hello.html\n# Output: hello world\n```\n\nThe key piece is the **post-receive hook** in `/git/server/hooks/post-receive` — it automatically deploys changes to the web directory whenever you push.","ttft_ms":3432,"type":"result","duration_ms":8769,"uuid":"94caa58d-cd92-4569-9d6f-b44cbbcda8c1","ttft_stream_ms":885,"time_to_request_ms":85,"queued_turn_count":0}
